# Changelog (engine/v1/)

## GLB export clips decals to their footprint

**What:** `buildDecalVertices` no longer exports whole host facets. Each facet selected by
`SelectDecalFacets` is clipped to the `[-0.5, 0.5]` uv square by the new `clipToDecalSquare`
(positions interpolated with uv) and fan-triangulated. Before clipping, facets whose uv winding is
opposite to that of the facet nearest the decal centre are dropped. `writeGlbBinary` writes
`asset.version` `"2.0"` in place of `"1.0"`.

**Where:** [Simulator.js](engine/v1/handlers/game/Simulator.js) — `decalClipPlanes` `:463`,
`clipToDecalSquare` `:466`, `buildDecalVertices` `:485`, `writeGlbBinary` asset block `:636`.

## GLB export subdivides decal facets with exact uv

**What:** `buildDecalVertices` subdivides each kept facet into `n × n` barycentric sub-triangles on
the facet plane before clipping. Sub-vertex uv comes from `DecalSurfaceUv`, with the facet's
first-corner arc as `referenceArc`. `n` per facet is `ceil(sqrt(error / decalUvTolerance))`, clamped
to `[1, decalMaxSubdivision]`, where `error` is the largest exact-vs-linear uv deviation at the edge
midpoints and centroid. New constants `decalUvTolerance` (`0.01`, in decal widths) and
`decalMaxSubdivision` (`16`). `Simulator.js` imports `DecalSurfaceUv` from `Render.js`.

**Where:** [Simulator.js](engine/v1/handlers/game/Simulator.js) — Render imports `:10`,
`decalUvTolerance` / `decalMaxSubdivision` `:373-374`, `buildDecalVertices` `:485`.

## Bounding-box grid lines built by one axis-indexed loop

**What:** `createGridLineVertices` replaces its 12 per-face loops with one nested loop over axis
indices: sweep axis `s`, face axis `k` (both min and max sides), line axis `l = 3 - s - k`. It
produces the same line segments in a different order.

**Where:** [Render.js](engine/v1/handlers/Render.js) — `createGridLineVertices` `:1040`.
